.TH JOUET 1
.SH NAME
jouet \- A toolkit CLI for coding agents
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBjouet\fR [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>
.SH DESCRIPTION
A toolkit CLI for coding agents
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
